.TH MYSTRNCPY 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils" "Library Functions"
.SH NAME
mystrncpy \- copy up to a specified number of characters
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.PP
.B int mystrncpy(char *dest, const char *src, int n);
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrncpy
function copies characters from the string pointed to by
.I src
into the buffer pointed to by
.I dest
up to a maximum of
.I n
characters.
.PP
If the source string is shorter than
.I n
characters, the remaining destination positions are filled with null characters.
The function returns the number of positions processed.
